usage: benchmark_turboquant_production.py [-h]
                                          [--backend {host,npu,npu-test,torch-cpu,torch-npu}]
                                          [--build-dir BUILD_DIR]
                                          [--host-build-dir HOST_BUILD_DIR]
                                          [--mode {all,lm4,lm3,e8}]
                                          [--stage {all,ingress,dequant,decode}]
                                          [--profile PROFILE]
                                          [--block-size {64,128}]
                                          [--device DEVICE] [--warmup WARMUP]
                                          [--iterations ITERATIONS] [--list]
                                          [--verify]

Run the TurboQuant production matrix or compare staged PyTorch reference
codecs.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --backend {host,npu,npu-test,torch-cpu,torch-npu}
  --build-dir BUILD_DIR
  --host-build-dir HOST_BUILD_DIR
                        Host profile catalog, if built separately
  --mode {all,lm4,lm3,e8}
  --stage {all,ingress,dequant,decode}
  --profile PROFILE     Profile name from --backend host --list
  --block-size {64,128}
  --device DEVICE
  --warmup WARMUP
  --iterations ITERATIONS
  --list                Print applicable profiles and native launch limits
  --verify              Run CPU golden and canary checks
